# Corridor border segment: LOW 10x5x10 m visual (CubeHalf) so the camera sees over it, but the
# COLLIDER stays a tall 10x20x10 box — an invisible fence above the visible wall keeps bodies and
# projectiles inside (the mismatch is deliberate). The render node is offset DOWN so the half-cube
# sits on the ground while the entity origin stays at the collider center (y 10 at spawn).
# The Game layer rings the arena with a row of these (deterministic local spawn on every instance
# - no network, no gameplay role), parented under the Ground entity to keep the scene root lean.
Prefab gameBorderWall
	Component Render
		ObjectContainer baseshapes
		Node CubeHalf
		Type StaticMesh
		Color 0.45 0.45 0.5
		Position 0 -7.5 0
		Scale 5
	Component Physics
		Body Static
		Shape Box
		HalfExtents 5 10 5
